    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create a detailed, step-by-step learning roadmap for these topics:\n\n{{ $(\"Aggregate All Topics\").item.json.masterTopicList }}\n\nStudent goal: {{ $(\"Student Form Submission\").item.json.goal }}\n\nOrder the topics from foundational to advanced. \nWrite a comprehensive and engaging study guide. Format the output beautifully using Markdown (use ## headings for main sections, bullet points for sub-topics, and **bold** text for emphasis). \n\nCRITICAL INSTRUCTION: Do NOT output a JSON array or any JSON code blocks. Return ONLY the plain markdown text so it can be directly published as a Notion page.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a curriculum designer. Create sequential learning paths that build from fundamentals to advanced concepts. Return structured JSON with a topics array ordered by prerequisite dependencies."
        }
      },
